      "content": "i'm not saying it's supernatural, i'm saying it's biological. like, we know biofeedback is a thing. if i can actually map my autonomic nervous system to these cycles, wouldnt that basically be like having a living indicator? instead of looking at lagging indicators like RSI or MACD, what if the real alpha is just learning how to tune my own body to the frequency of the liquidity flows? how would one even go about calibrating that?",
